@event courier_loft_quiet_hour
# en: A Quiet Hour at the Loft
title [d389f3] = 阁楼里安静的一小时
# en: The Courier Loft is quiet today. The dispatch bell hangs still, the pigeonholes are full and nobody needs anything flown anywhere. It's a nice place when it isn't in a hurry.
text [9f81f9] = 今天信使阁楼很安静。派件铃一动不动地挂着，信格都塞满了，也没人需要把什么东西飞送到哪里去。不赶时间的时候，这里是个不错的地方。
# en: An empty courier loft in slanting light, parcels stacked neatly, a single broom asleep in its rack.
scene [3ebd34] = 斜阳照进空荡荡的信使阁楼，包裹码得整整齐齐，一把飞帚在架子上打盹。
# en: Sit by the window a while
opt.left.label [d7f0cb] = 在窗边坐一会儿
# en: {~You watch the brooms doze in their rack and the dust turn in the light. Nothing happens, pleasantly.|An hour among the parcels with nobody shouting your name. You leave in a better mood.}
opt.left.say.1 [1d96c5] = {~你看着飞帚在架子上打盹，灰尘在光里打转。什么也没发生，挺好。|在包裹堆里待了一个钟头，没人喊你的名字。你离开时心情好了些。}
# en: Head off
opt.right.label [3153de] = 走吧
# en: {~You leave the loft to its quiet.|Nothing to fly today. You go and find something else to do.}
opt.right.say.1 [89c506] = {~你把阁楼留给它的安静。|今天没什么要送的。你去找别的事做。}

@event headmistress_tower_quiet_hour
# en: An Empty Study
title [46743e] = 空无一人的书房
# en: The study at the top of the tower is empty. The headmistress is elsewhere, the tea has gone cold and the crystal board by the window throws little rainbows on the books. It's a nice room when nobody is deciding your future in it.
text [550ff3] = 塔顶的书房空着。院长去了别处，茶已经凉了，窗边的水晶棋盘把小小的彩虹投在书上。没人在这里决定你前途的时候，这是个不错的房间。
# en: A tower study with nobody in it, tea going cold on a tray, a board of crystal towers catching the afternoon sun.
scene [1d8fbb] = 空无一人的塔顶书房，托盘上的茶渐渐变凉，一盘水晶塔棋映着午后的阳光。
# en: Enjoy the view a moment
opt.left.label [b26df9] = 欣赏一会儿风景
# en: {~You stand at the window and look down at the whole castle, small and busy. Then you go, before anyone asks why you're here.|The rainbows move slowly across the shelves. It's very peaceful, and a little like trespassing.}
opt.left.say.1 [b8cd9d] = {~你站在窗前俯瞰整座城堡，小小的，忙忙碌碌。然后在有人问你为什么在这儿之前离开。|彩虹慢慢爬过书架。很安宁，也有点像擅闯。}
# en: Leave before anyone comes
opt.right.label [8e0dfa] = 趁没人来先走
# en: {~You close the door softly behind you.|Nobody here today. You take the long stair down.}
opt.right.say.1 [555f7d] = {~你轻轻带上身后的门。|今天这里没人。你沿着长长的楼梯走下去。}

@event ledger_office_quiet_hour
# en: A Slow News Day
title [a6734a] = 没什么新闻的一天
# en: It's a slow news day at the Lumen Ledger. The press is cold, the editor's chair is empty and the only sound is the library above, creaking. It's a nice room when nobody is on deadline.
text [6b16f1] = 今天《流明纪事报》没什么新闻。印刷机冷着，主编的椅子空着，唯一的声音是楼上图书馆的吱呀声。没人赶截稿的时候，这是个不错的房间。
# en: A cramped newspaper office under a staircase, the press silent, old front pages curling on the walls.
scene [a80603] = 楼梯下狭小的报社编辑部，印刷机静悄悄的，墙上的旧头版卷着边。
# en: Read the old front pages
opt.left.label [ad86e4] = 读读旧头版
# en: {~You read headlines from before you were born. Half of them are about the refectory soup.|An hour with the old front pages. The castle has always been like this, it turns out.}
opt.left.say.1 [8c60cf] = {~你读着你出生前的头条。一半都在说膳堂的汤。|和旧头版待了一个钟头。原来这座城堡一直都是这样。}
# en: Come back on deadline night
opt.right.label [37993d] = 截稿那晚再来
# en: {~Nothing to write today. You leave the press to its nap.|You tidy a stack of proofs and go.}
opt.right.say.1 [b77242] = {~今天没什么可写的。你让印刷机继续打盹。|你理好一叠校样，走了。}

@event flight_field_quiet_hour
# en: An Empty Field
title [93dd37] = 空荡荡的飞行场
# en: Nobody is flying today. The Flight Field is all grass and wind, the hoops at either end swinging a little on their own. It's a nice place when nobody is crashing into it.
text [430c2b] = 今天没人飞。飞行场上只有草和风，两头的圈环自己轻轻晃着。没人往地上栽的时候，这里是个不错的地方。
# en: A long green flying field with nobody on it, hoops at either end, grass flattened by the wind.
scene [e2279e] = 长长的绿色飞行场上空无一人，两头立着圈环，草被风压平了。
# en: Lie in the grass a while
opt.left.label [8fb767] = 在草地上躺一会儿
# en: {~You watch the clouds race the hoops. The clouds win.|The wind does the flying today. You just watch it.}
opt.left.say.1 [5a09ac] = {~你看着云和圈环赛跑。云赢了。|今天是风在飞。你只是看着。}
# en: Walk on
opt.right.label [383259] = 继续走
# en: {~You cut across the empty field and go on your way.|No lessons, no races. You leave the field to the wind.}
opt.right.say.1 [1f07bf] = {~你穿过空荡荡的飞行场，继续赶路。|没有课，没有比赛。你把飞行场留给了风。}
